==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{deverbal|ru|подобра́ть}} + {{af|ru|-ка}}, based on the nominal combining stem {{m|ru||подбор-}}, derived from the present tense stem {{m|ru||подбер-}} with Indo-European ''o''-vocalization characteristic of deverbal nouns.

